{
  "bookId": "hero-214103",
  "id": "bond-41106",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41106001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "没有来过的地方，稍微有点紧张的说……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "锵锵——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是给库特的惊喜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼！？这里是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "是天文台的说！还是半露天的设计！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没错，这样的话库特晚上看星星的时候，就可以偶尔用天文望远镜了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "简直是super surprise的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "感觉光是感谢的话语，已经完全不能表达内心的情感了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "现在心里仿佛在经历宇宙big bang一样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "冷静，冷静……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "作为感谢话语的替代，库特可以帮我实现一个愿望吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "41106014",
              "text": "库特愿意告诉我更多有关星星的故事吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "41106014",
              "text": "我想知道更多有关星星的知识，库特教教我！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "41106013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "诶？当，当然no problem的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "可是这样就够了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "十分足够了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "毕竟能看到库特讲述星星时眼睛闪闪发亮的样子，就是最好的感谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "唔，那你可要做好prepare的说！关于星星的事情我可是会说很久的哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41106019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我会努力的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
